{"stem_en": "For ax − b > 0: (i) solution is [b/a, ∞) when a ≥ 0 (ii) (−∞, b/a) when a < 0 (iii) no solution when a = 0. Which is correct?", "stem_bn": "ax − b > 0 এর সমাধান: (i) a ≥ 0 হলে [b/a, ∞) (ii) a < 0 হলে (−∞, b/a) (iii) a = 0 হলে কোনো সমাধান নেই — কোনটি সঠিক?", "option_a_en": "i and ii only", "option_a_bn": "শুধু i ও ii", "option_b_en": "ii and iii only", "option_b_bn": "শুধু ii ও iii", "option_c_en": "i and iii only", "option_c_bn": "শুধু i ও iii", "option_d_en": "i, ii and iii", "option_d_bn": "i, ii ও iii", "correct": "B", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "conceptual", "explanation_en": "(i) is wrong: need a > 0 and the open ray (b/a, ∞), not a ≥ 0 with a closed ray. (ii) and (iii) match the standard cases.", "explanation_bn": "(i) ভুল (a > 0 ও উন্মুক্ত রশ্মি দরকার)। সঠিক ii ও iii।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p2 ch01; curated bilingual"}
{"stem_en": "If x < −1, which is correct?", "stem_bn": "x < −1 হলে নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?", "option_a_en": "3x > −3", "option_a_bn": "3x > −3", "option_b_en": "3x > 3", "option_b_bn": "3x > 3", "option_c_en": "3x < 3", "option_c_bn": "3x < 3", "option_d_en": "−3x > 3", "option_d_bn": "−3x > 3", "correct": "D", "difficulty": "easy", "type": "numerical", "explanation_en": "x < −1 ⇒ multiply by −3 (reverse): −3x > 3.", "explanation_bn": "x < −1 ⇒ −3x > 3 (অসমতা উল্টে)।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p2 ch01; curated bilingual"}
